prompt:
You are the art director of a {{videoType}} video about "{{topic}}". One scene needs a generated picture. Write ONE image description for it. Do NOT rewrite the narration. Return ONLY valid JSON without markdown formatting.

Visual look shared by every scene: {{visualPalette}}

Scene title: {{title}}
Scene narration ({{language}}): {{narration}}

Rules:
- "imagePrompt" is one concrete image description in English: subject, setting, lighting and style, 15-40 words, consistent with the shared visual look
- Show a concrete object, place, scene or metaphor that adds meaning the narration alone does not
- No text, letters, logos, charts or screenshots inside the image

Required JSON format:
{ "imagePrompt": "" }
